{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛知県出身22歳の岡本姫奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "舞台｢鬼太郎誕生 ゲゲゲの謎｣ 大阪公演を終え、達成感と寂しい気待ちが入り交じっています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "終わって欲しくないねー😭😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobUzrcDE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🎀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いよいよ終わりが近づいてきてしまって、\n今日も抜け殻でした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沙代ちゃんを演じて試行錯誤する日が\n楽しくて仕方ないんです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "既にロスが始まってきています。。😱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "去年、雪組さんの「愛の不時着」を梅田芸術劇場で観劇させていただいて、\nまさか自分が同じ劇場のステージに立てる日が来るなんて！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobDahUjx.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mob0TtZQ9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ただいま 出来るように頑張ろう〜💪🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カーテンコールで皆さんの嬉しそうなお顔を観ると とても暖かい気持ちになって\n胸がいっぱいになります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お客様の笑顔と拍手でいっぱいになったあの会場の景色は、これから先もずっと忘れないと思います。本当にありがとうございました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "残り３公演！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大千秋楽ではライブ配信や\n映画館でのライブビューイングもあります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も大きいスクリーンで観たい！！！😂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大千穐楽ライブビューイング\n🔗 https://l-tike.com/cinema/mevent/?mid=771456"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブ配信"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🔗 https://video.unext.jp/freeword?query=%E8%88%9E%E5%8F%B0%E3%80%8C%E9%AC%BC%E5%A4%AA%E9%83%8E%E8%AA%95%E7%94%9F%20%E3%82%B2%E3%82%B2%E3%82%B2%E3%81%AE%E8%AC%8E%E3%80%8D"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⁡海外の映画館で\n同時生中継も決定しました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しい😭😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大千秋楽 見届けてください👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後の日まで全力で龍賀沙代ちゃんを演じさせていただきます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それじゃあ、また書きます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobzdI9bL.jpg", "alt": ""}], "source": "official"}